能均分，所以我们摘下了第二顶。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304002 lisha&amp;luyisi.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/37/Spine_static-304002_lisha%26luyisi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"299\" height=\"423\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"299\" data-file-height=\"423\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3040\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%8E%26%E8%B7%AF%E6%98%93%E6%96%AF\" title=\"丽莎&amp;路易斯\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%8E%26%E8%B7%AF%E6%98%93%E6%96%AF\" title=\"丽莎&amp;路易斯\"><img alt=\"丽莎&amp;路易斯\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-304001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/72/HeadIconSmall-304001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%8E%26%E8%B7%AF%E6%98%93%E6%96%AF\" title=\"丽莎&amp;路易斯\">丽莎&amp;路易斯</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>黑白64方格</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304002</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一份陈旧的日记，记载着同一种歪拙的笔记<br />4月27日<br />今天爸爸给我带了一份生日礼物，是国际象棋，我很喜欢！<br />今天爸爸给我带了一份生日礼物，是国际象棋，我很喜欢！但丽莎你会下棋吗？<br />这不重要！路易斯，这只是一场游戏，像我们以前所有的游戏那样！<br /><br />4月29日<br />丽莎赢了！<br />路易斯也赢了！我喜欢我的朋友，这样就能够同时拥有双份的快乐！<br /><br />4月30日<br />丽莎收到了路易斯的礼物！一顶王后的王冠！<br />路易斯收到了丽莎的礼物！一顶国王的王冠！这是丽莎亲手摘下来的，路易斯很喜欢！</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304002\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Belonging-304004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“远征者的嘉奖”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Reward for the Long March\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />460<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>两件一模一样的上装，上有以刺绣工艺制作的图样，图样描绘了最渺小者向死而生的伟大景象。<br />“向那里走！向那里走！”<br />孩子们坚定地指着最远的地方。没人知道孩子们将会在旅途中遇见什么，但受访者透露行进至终点者终将为王。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/39/Belonging-304005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">不那么简单发卡<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Not Just Any Hairband</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />35<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“这是我们最厉害的武器！”<br />受访者异口同声地说。<br />“它没那么简单，也不普通，我们能通过它来控制棋子的移动。”<br />但在笔者看来，它们并不具备什么神秘学上的能力。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0b/Belonging-304006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“我们想到了办法”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Now No One Can Tell Us Apart!\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一对不明材质的圆球，并不属于服装设计的一部分。<br />孩子们拒绝透露圆球的来源，而笔者在角落发现了两枚倒在地上的士兵棋子，它们的头部均不翼而飞。<br />“我们想到办法了，我们终于凑成了一对。”<br />关于二人的身份，现在我们确实无从推测了。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 升变华尔兹1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B91.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 升变华尔兹2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%87%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B92.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">升变华尔兹 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Pawn's Promotional Waltz</small></span></span>"}}